ds anymore either.",9,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","think",null],["say","avg3_100","(How would I even find this place without her...?)",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","011","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Loud and clear. I promise.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_049"],["say","avg1_115","Mhm. Good! Now then—",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["bg","4051_B",0,1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1.5],["say","0","A tiny hand gently wraps around my fingers. Firefly looks up at the stars with a faint smile.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_115","Let's climb the Monolith together again. Then, when we're done playing, we can rest right here.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_115","From today on, this is Firefly and Tyrant's secret base.",9,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","014","music","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","Heh. I'm honored.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Thank you, Firefly. You'll have to bring me here again next time.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"jushou"],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_115","Mhm. It's a promise.",9,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,2.0],["w",1.0],["say","0","Inside this Monolith, where no stars should ever shine, countless specks of starlight drift softly down...",8,""],["bgm",""],["say","0","The silent stars seem to gently rock a cradle, quietly watching over us as we rest...",8,""],["w",1.0],["end"]]}